{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36600","headline":"孙员外赴阙後重到三衢 · 罗隐","name":"孙员外赴阙後重到三衢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远山高树思悠哉，重倚危楼尽一杯。\n谢守已随徵诏入，鲁儒犹逐断蓬来。\n地寒谩忆移暄手，时急方须济世才。\n宣室夜阑如有问，可能全望未然灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}